\p{I am Yve Meng. This is my personal website, realised as a [forester space](https://www.forester-notes.org/index/index.xml). You can find more information about me in my [bio](sezryo), or directly [contact me](0006) for even further discussions.}
\p{This website primarily serves as a research [note](0002) of my current studies. Additionally, my random thoughts are also posted here, making part of this website to be a casual blog.}
\p{Pages of this site may be written in multiple or mixed languages.}
\p{You may navigate this whole [forester](https://www.forester-notes.org/index/index.xml) via \code{ctrl+K}.}

